# Aderyn triage — acknowledged finding instances, one key per line.
#
# Covers every high-severity finding, plus the low-severity detectors promoted
# to gating in script/gate_aderyn.py.
#
# Key format: detector_name|contract_path|line_no
#
# This file records review decisions: a finding is read, judged a false positive
# or an accepted risk, and the key committed here with the reasoning above it.
#
# Stability: aderyn anchors an instance at the enclosing function declaration,
# not at the offending statement, so keys survive edits inside a function body.
# They do not survive inserting or deleting lines above the function, which
# means the finding is re-reviewed rather than silently inherited.
